WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,730
Experience packs are everywhere

2
00:00:03,730 --> 00:00:05,730
Which spirit wolf can endure it?

3
00:00:05,730 --> 00:00:07,730
Just lick it and that's it

4
00:00:07,730 --> 00:00:19,010
A starving ghost reincarnated

5
00:00:19,010 --> 00:00:21,230
Do you understand elegance?

6
00:00:21,230 --> 00:00:22,230
You slowly become elegant

7
00:00:22,230 --> 00:00:33,020
Don't rush

8
00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:34,020
There are many more

9
00:00:34,020 --> 00:00:35,020
Not in a hurry yet

10
00:00:35,020 --> 00:00:36,020
Just talk

11
00:00:36,020 --> 00:00:37,020
That Tang Wolf ate another whole one

12
00:00:37,020 --> 00:00:38,090
Are those all infinite spaces?

13
00:00:38,090 --> 00:00:40,090
I can't get enough to eat. Hold on.

14
00:00:40,090 --> 00:00:41,090
He is too strong

15
00:00:41,090 --> 00:00:42,090
Can't rush away rashly

16
00:00:42,090 --> 00:00:43,090
Let’s give it to him often

17
00:00:43,090 --> 00:00:52,410
Taste-changing accompaniments

18
00:00:52,410 --> 00:00:53,410
I said brother

19
00:00:53,410 --> 00:00:54,410
Can you give me a leg?

20
00:00:54,410 --> 00:00:55,410
The legs are right here

21
00:00:55,410 --> 00:00:56,410
Plump and meaty

22
00:00:56,410 --> 00:00:57,410
Come and get it

23
00:00:57,410 --> 00:00:58,410
Throw it over

24
00:00:58,410 --> 00:00:59,410
Don't dare to come over

25
00:00:59,410 --> 00:01:01,410
Then just watch over there or

26
00:01:01,410 --> 00:01:03,410
There is an eighth-grade golden monkey over there

27
00:01:03,410 --> 00:01:04,410
It's better to eat that one

28
00:01:04,410 --> 00:01:05,410
Why don't you go eat the eighth-grade golden monkey?

29
00:01:05,410 --> 00:01:06,410
You ate so much green and yellow

30
00:01:06,410 --> 00:01:07,410
I want one now

31
00:01:07,410 --> 00:01:08,410
King Qinghuang won’t even give him any legs.

32
00:01:08,410 --> 00:01:09,410
Wei Mei is too stingy, right?

33
00:01:09,410 --> 00:01:10,410
If you want leg meat, come here

34
00:01:10,410 --> 00:01:11,410
Otherwise get out

35
00:01:11,410 --> 00:01:12,410
Otherwise, wait a while

36
00:01:12,410 --> 00:01:13,410
You can't get away even if you want to.

37
00:01:13,410 --> 00:01:19,630
Energy accumulation is full

38
00:01:19,630 --> 00:01:20,630
Whether to upgrade
